  "title": "Krispy Kreme® Announces Expansion into Estonia",
  "summary": "Advances goal of adding three to four new markets in 2026 through capital-light international franchise growth CHARLOTTE, N.C. June 29, 2026 – Krispy Kreme, Inc. (NASDAQ: DNUT) (“Krispy Kreme” or the “Company”) today announced an agreement with Apollo Group to bring Krispy Kreme to Estonia, with the country’s first shop expected to open in late 2026. The first Hot Light Theater Shop in Estonia will feature the brand’s iconic Hot Light experience and serve as both a retail location and a producti",
